{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9fe4e7a201e6ecb47eb001551368cb21f910132ddab6454881d3def8c29f4f24", "ja": "麗花、さっきはメールありがとう。\nケンジ君は、もう行ったのか？", "zh": "丽花，刚才谢谢你的邮件。健司已经走了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_104_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "36e04a21cfd54baea066a7318faa93e88a0d1f9b148266e204a31d4feef66a48", "ja": "はい。今朝、あの公園でお別れしてきました。", "zh": "是的。今天早上，我在那个公园和他道别了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
